OL,3,AFarage to make speech at Reform
OL,4,Aconference after denying party has
OL,5,Ataken any 'illegal money'
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhat do the political donation
OL,8,Fguidelines say? BBC Verify takes a look
OL,10,FIn Birmingham, Reform's annual
OL,11,Fconference is under way, with Farage
OL,12,Fannouncing earlier that his party has
OL,13,Fsigned an agreement with the hard-right
OL,14,FNational Rally on small boat crossings
OL,15,Fbetween France and the UK
OL,17,FFarage is due to make his keynote
OL,18,Fspeech shortly - you'll be able to
OL,19,Fwatch live above
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
