OL,3,AFarage unveils small boats deal with
OL,4,AFrench National Rally party
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was signed at Reform's annual
OL,7,Fconference in Birmingham by RN
OL,8,FPresident Jordan Bardella, whose party
OL,9,Fis currently leading in opinion polls
OL,10,Fahead of presidential elections in
OL,11,FApril next year.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
